    "common_protocol": "All tasks are episodic supervised binary-target problems with cross-entropy and sigmoid outputs. Controller state, read vectors and memory reset at episode start. Compare feedforward-controller NTM, LSTM-controller NTM and a three-layer LSTM baseline. Results are bits per sequence.",
